
* BUILD INSTRUCTIONS *

Requirements:
 - Qore development environment (lib and headers)
 - Cmake
 - (optional) Doxygen
 - Boost 1.90.0 is bundled, including required Boost.Process correctness fixes.
   By default the bundled dependencies are built too. Distribution builds can
   use -DUSE_SYSTEM_BOOST_DEPENDENCIES=ON with Boost 1.90.0 development packages
   to use system dependencies and link only the patched Boost.Process library
   privately into the module. This mode requires USE_INTERNAL_BOOST to be OFF.

Use so called "out of source" build

 - mkdir build   (in module directory)
 - cd build
 - cmake -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/to/install ..   (if there is not -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX specified, the Qore module dire is used)
 - make
 - cross fingers
 - make install

Some tests are located in "test" directory.
